<title>FINLAND: Silja Jan passenger volume up 7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Silja Jan passenger volume up 7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator Silja Oy Ab said in a statement on Wednesday the number of passengers carried in January by its Baltic Sea operator Silja Line rose seven percent year-on-year to 360,494.  </p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> Passenger volume (1,000)	    Jan 1997	change yr/yr</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		     89,585	   +11 pct</p>
<p> Turku-Stockholm			 135,016	    +9 pct</p>
<p> Vaasa-Umea				 30,162	   +20 pct</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn			 91,434	    -6 pct</p>
<p> Finnjet				    14,297	   +34 pct</p>
<p> TOTAL passengers			360,494	    +7 pct</p>
<p> Cars					 17,629	    -4 pct</p>
<p> Freight units			    11,104	   +10 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
